  id: S01_06
  era: "Palaeolithic \xB7 Section 1 \xB7 Prehistoric India \xB7 c. 1.5 million years ago \u2013 700 BCE"
  title: Hunter-gatherer lifestyle
  text: Palaeolithic people lived in small, mobile bands. They hunted deer, wild cattle and pigs, and gathered fruit, roots and honey. They camped near rivers and in rock shelters, moving with the seasons. There was no farming, pottery or permanent village yet.
